<title>HONG KONG: Far East 1996 net loss HK$13.38 mln.</title>
<headline>Far East 1996 net loss HK$13.38 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	4.5 loss   vs 7.8 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents) nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     2.19 loss  vs 19.42 loss</p>
<p>    Net			 13.38 loss vs 23.31 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		  316.41     vs 191.19</p>
<p>    Company name	    Far East Holdings International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     June 25-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Far East Holdings engages in property investment, cinema operation and leisure-related business.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$8.78 million on dealing of foreign exchange forward contracts, gain of HK$6.48 million on provision for diminution in value of investments written back and gain of HK$0.12 million on dealing of options and futures contracts.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
